            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**196 hectares of mountainside are simply gone.**\n\nThe scar was mapped from Landsat 9 imagery of the day it happened. NDRRMA put the mass that detached at roughly a square\nkilometre of rock-glacier material.\n\nIt sits directly above the Lhende Khola, a side stream that joins the Bhote Koshi\nabout ten kilometres below. Nothing lives up here. Everything that follows is\nwhat happened downhill of it.\n\n**On the map:** the brown outline is the source area\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The ground it came off"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000002": {
      "name": "Ten minutes later the gauge went quiet",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 11.6,
        "extent": [
          9471563.03209108,
          3248207.6342882994,
          9528447.656704696,
          3290114.658272268
        ],
        "transition": {
