          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "markdown",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Almost everything this map has shown you being destroyed was in the mountains.\nAlmost everyone who died was on the plain.**\n\nDeaths by district, as NDRRMA record them:\n\n- **Chitwan 321**\n- **Nawalparasi East 216**, **West 170**\n- Nuwakot 95 · Gorkha 65 · Dhading 55 · Tanahun 38\n- **Rasuwa 27**\n\n707 of 987 deaths are in the three districts\nfurthest from the mountain, where the flood was slowest and the damage least.\nRasuwa, where it tore the valley open, has 27.\n\nThe gorge had almost nothing in it. The plain is where people live. A flood does\nits worst where the ground is steep, and it kills where the people are, and\nthose are not the same place.\n\n*Draft. Arjun to rewrite.*\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "It destroyed the most upstream and killed the most downstream"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000012": {
      "name": "The people",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 9.6,
        "extent": [
          9348387.468300542,
          3152557.86960285,
          9575925.966755012,
          3320185.965538724
