            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "markdown",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**As of 2026-09-01, NDRRMA counted:**\n\n- **987 dead**, including recovered remains\n- **3,916 missing**, reported across 62 districts — 1,558 from Nuwakot, 865 from Rasuwa, 639 from hydropower project sites, 583 foreign nationals\n- **279** injured, 168 discharged\n- **11,814 rescued**, 3,702 of them by air\n\nAnd for six days after the water, **3,702 households,\n14,461 people** in Gosaikunda and Amachhodingmo were cut off\nentirely: no road, no electricity, no telephone.\n\n**8 schools** were destroyed and\n8 damaged, out of 19\nassessed carrying 6,901 pupils.\n\nThese are the figures published at 09:00 on 1 September and they moved daily.\n[NDRRMA](https://bipadportal.gov.np/) publishes the current ones.\n\n**On the map:** schools inside the flood extent, red where destroyed\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The people"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000013": {
      "name": "Four counts of the same thing",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.8,
        "extent": [
          9430547.08159633,
          3217447.3413577504,
          9529588.965596877,
          3290411.7080283663
        ],
        "transition": {
          "type": "linear",
          "time": 2.2
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 0.25
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
